     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Enter the fractions in Desmos (desmos.com) using “/” for the fraction bar.</p>\n<p>What you enter: <span data-math=\"124/297\"></span></p>\n<p>You see a fraction in the workspace and a decimal in the answer area.</p>\n<p>Arrow out of the fraction and press <span data-math=\"+.\"></span></p>\n<p>Enter the second fraction: <span data-math=\"3/125\"></span></p>\n<p>The answer area shows <span data-math=\"0.4415084175.\"></span></p>\n<p>Click on the “convert to fraction button.” It looks like <span data-math=\"\\frac{\\square}{\\square}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>You will see the final answer, <span data-math=\"\\frac{{16,391}}{{37,125}}\"></span>.</p>"
    },
